program	conformance/D12_drive_never_body_refused.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	a task body may not be `Never`: `halt` never returns, so `__saw_drive` would drive it for ever
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: a task body may not be `Never`: `halt` never returns, so `__saw_drive` would drive it for ever"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/D12_drive_never_body_refused.saw:21:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 21 |     __saw_drive(halt(1))"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: a task is something to wait for, and a `Never` body gives it a result that cannot exist. Write a forever-task as `-> Void` with a loop — `func serve() { while { ... } }` — and end it by cancelling the task or breaking the loop"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
